  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with singleprofile, pca_n2000 RNA encoder, and resnet50 image encoder achieve ~0.52 accuracy. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with a larger imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping other settings identical (aggregation=None, fusion=concat). This clarifies whether the image encoder's capacity significantly impacts performance, a critical design choice. It balances exploration of a key component (image encoder) with minimal changes to the existing promising setup."
